name: Contaminated Water
description: A darkened version of regular Water exclusive to the rocky bodies of the Epsilon Boötis A system. It's unpurity is easy to spot due to its slightly darker color and composition of extreme amounts of minerals, toxic metals, and other things. Its main uses are in power generation and in early game cooling as it's still able to capacitate heat even if it's not strong. It can be purified, however, to create a better cooler. 
